  "description": {
    "text": "Ten cards McDonald's gave with its Happy Sets in Japan in July 2005, 081 to 090 PCG-P: six from 1 July and four more added on 8 July. Several are Pokémon of that summer's film, Lucario and the Mystery of Mew: Mew, Aura's Lucario and Rota's Mime Jr., Bonsly, Munchlax and Weavile. The Grovyle, Combusken, Mudkip and Pikachu drawings are also on English cards of POP Series 4, booster packs given out at Pokémon Organized Play events.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokeboon: 7月1日（金）からマクドナルドにポケモンカードゲームが登場【2005年】",
        "url": "https://pokeboon.com/jp/promo_event/pcg-mcdonalds-pokemon-card-game-july-1/"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokumon: Grovyle (081/PCG-P Japanese Promo)",
        "url": "https://pokumon.com/card/grovyle-081-pcg-p-japanese-promo/"
      },
      {
        "title": "Wikipedia: Pokémon: Lucario and the Mystery of Mew",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pok%C3%A9mon:_Lucario_and_the_Mystery_of_Mew"
      }
    ]
  },
